                  "TextBlobForSerialisation": "(string)FUNCTION UDS_WriteCallback\nVAR_INPUT\n\tUDSReadData_pau8 : POINTER TO USINT;\nEND_VAR\nVAR\n\tDidValue_u16     : UINT;\t\n\tDiagChkLvlRet_u8 : USINT;\n\tLevel_pu8        : POINTER TO USINT;\nEND_VAR\n",
                  "LineInfoPersistence": "(string)d04d4543-d4ec-40a5-b735-32d27b61ed75_Decl_LineIds"
